 <p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-left:26.4pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:
-26.4pt"><i><span lang="EN-GB"><a class="reflex2-link" href="https://qweri.lexum.com/w/calegis/rsc-1985-c-c-44-en#!fragment/sec102subsec1" target="_blank">Canada Business Corporations Act<span class="decisia-reflex2-icon">&nbsp;<span class="icon-external-link"></span></span></a></span></i><span lang="EN-GB"><a class="reflex2-link" href="https://qweri.lexum.com/w/calegis/rsc-1985-c-c-44-en#!fragment/sec102subsec1" target="_blank">, R.S.C. 1985, c.&nbsp;C‑44<span class="decisia-reflex2-icon">&nbsp;<span class="icon-external-link"></span></span></a></span><span lang="EN-GB"></span><span lang="EN-GB"></span><span lang="EN-GB"><a class="reflex2-link" href="https://qweri.lexum.com/w/calegis/rsc-1985-c-c-44-en#!fragment/sec102subsec1" target="_blank">, ss.&nbsp;102(1)<span class="decisia-reflex2-icon">&nbsp;<span class="icon-external-link"></span></span></a></span><span lang="EN-GB">, <a class="reflex2-link" href="https://qweri.lexum.com/w/calegis/rsc-1985-c-c-44-en#!fragment/sec122" target="_blank">122<span class="decisia-reflex2-icon">&nbsp;<span class="icon-external-link"></span></span></a>, <a class="reflex2-link" href="https://qweri.lexum.com/w/calegis/rsc-1985-c-c-44-en#!fragment/sec192" target="_blank">192<span class="decisia-reflex2-icon">&nbsp;<span class="icon-external-link"></span></span></a>, <a class="reflex2-link" href="https://qweri.lexum.com/w/calegis/rsc-1985-c-c-44-en#!fragment/sec239" target="_blank">239<span class="decisia-reflex2-icon">&nbsp;<span class="icon-external-link"></span></span></a>,<a class="reflex2-link" href="https://qweri.lexum.com/w/calegis/rsc-1985-c-c-44-en#!fragment/sec241" target="_blank"> 241<span class="decisia-reflex2-icon">&nbsp;<span class="icon-external-link"></span></span></a>.</span></p>
